{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><h1>青衣碼頭一度誤傳有人墮海 驚動水警消防趕至搜索</h1><p>更新時間：22:14 2026-10-05 HKT<br/>發佈時間：22:01 2026-10-05 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：22:01 2026-10-05 HKT</p><p>青衣渡輪碼頭對開，今日（10月5日）晚上9時許有人報案，指一名男子墮海，懷疑輕生。水警船及消防輪接報趕至，分別在沿岸及海面搜索男子蹤影。惟至晚上10時，警方相信事件涉及有人虛報，確定無人墮海，搜救人員遂陸續收隊離開。</p><img alt=\"至晚上10時許，警方相信事件涉及有人虛報，確定無人墮海。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7197a4f5bc1cc03b7b0eb4c49779e9c1/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_22_07_11.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場位於青衣碼頭附近。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5276d825921ed3a48d3d9d8eadf1aaa7/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_21_51_05_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場位於青衣碼頭附近。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eb4319e907b9e98b4bf47bc317e88c7d/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_21_51_04.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"水警船及消防輪趕至搜索。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/170aa5667b7bd1601f542c094c64a8ee/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_21_59_35.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"水警船及消防輪趕至搜索。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1f8a6e6d69e9457973f9a14e688f4cb5/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_21_54_02_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防員及救護員在岸上戒備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f43853240fc209cbfc0cb635bfae8fc9/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_21_51_05.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防員及救護員在岸上戒備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/874811f99fa6fd4c8aaa400b48d50cc6/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_21_51_06.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防員及救護員在岸上戒備。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42b09433a35db53f8c20245ff33b16ca/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_21_51_05_2_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T14:20:45.846517+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":215,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}